<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal inflation rose to 0.3 pct in August.</title>
<headline>Portugal inflation rose to 0.3 pct in August.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese consumer prices rose 0.3 percent in August after 0.2 percent in July to give year-on-year inflation of 3.6 percent after 3.8 percent previously, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Average annual inflation, the government's yardstick, was 3.3 percent in August after 3.4 percent previously.</p>
<p> PORTUGUESE INFLATION	  Aug 96	 July 96    Aug 95</p>
<p> Monthly CPI rise		  0.3	    0.2	  0.5</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr inflation		3.6	    3.8	  4.0</p>
<p> Average annual inflation	3.3	    3.4	  4.3</p>
<p> Index (base 100 1991)	 132.0	  131.6	127.4</p>
</text>
